# Official APNs bootstrap and service hosts.
# - init-p01md.apple.com: APNs initialization bootstrap host (exact)
# - push.apple.com: covers courier/api/gateway APNs service subdomains
# APNs Akamai CNAME targets (push-apple.com.akadns.net) are not request
# hostnames and are intentionally not listed; IP-based routing uses apple.list.
DOMAIN,init-p01md.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,push.apple.com
